labware_catalogue.json and liquid_classes.json are exports from a Hamilton Microlab Prep (its labware and liquid class lists). They are included
so the Builder and converter offer exactly what the instrument knows. To use your own instrument's lists instead, replace them with GET /labware and
GET /liquids from your Prep and run scripts/build-prep-catalogue.js.

Use at your own risk: this software drives a laboratory robot. Test in simulation first.
